<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 335-3 V AUSTRALIA, 2ND DAY, 1ST TEST - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 335-3 V AUSTRALIA, 2ND DAY, 1ST TEST - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, replying to Australia's first innings total of 118, were 335 for three at lunch on the second day of the first test at Edgbaston on Friday.</p>
</text>
